{"name":"Beef Patties","hex":"#bb5533","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"beef","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The meat from cattle or other bovines; especially, that from adults.","The edible portions of a cow (including those which are not meat)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To complain.","To add weight or strength to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beef"},{"term":"patties","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of patty","plural of pattie"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/patties"}],"entries":[{"title":"Jamaican patty","blocks":[{"text":"A Jamaican patty is a semicircular pastry that contains various fillings and spices baked inside a flaky shell, often tinted golden yellow with an egg yolk mixture, annatto or turmeric. It is a type of turnover, and is formed by folding the circular dough cutout over the chosen filling, but is savoury and filled with ground meat."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Jamaican_patties_and_redstripe.jpg/330px-Jamaican_patties_and_redstripe.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamaican_patty"},{"title":"Beef","blocks":[{"text":"Beef is the culinary name for meat from cattle. Beef can be prepared in various ways; cuts are often used for steak, which can be cooked to varying degrees of doneness, while trimmings are often ground or minced, as found in most hamburgers. Beef contains protein, iron, and vitamin B12. Along with other kinds of red meat, high consumption is associated with an increased risk of colorectal cancer and cardiovascular disease, especially when processed. Beef has a high environmental impact, being a primary driver of deforestation with the highest greenhouse gas emissions of any agricultural product."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Standing-rib-roast.jpg/330px-Standing-rib-roast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beef"},{"title":"Patty","blocks":[{"text":"A patty is a flattened, usually round, serving of ground meat or legumes, grains, vegetables, or meat alternatives. Common ground meat used include beef, chicken, and salmon. Patties are found in multiple cuisines throughout the world."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Hamburger_patty.jpg/330px-Hamburger_patty.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patty"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Curry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg/500px-Curry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Curry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg/1280px-Curry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Curry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg/500px-Curry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Curry goat patty from Devon House Bakery, Jamaica.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACurry_goat_patty_from_Devon_House%2C_Jamaica..jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Coco_bread_wrapped_beef_patty.jpg/500px-Coco_bread_wrapped_beef_patty.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Coco_bread_wrapped_beef_patty.jpg/500px-Coco_bread_wrapped_beef_patty.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Coco bread stuffed with a beef patty","link":"https://en.wiki